账面盈利_{i,t} = \sum_p (Close_{i,t} - Price_{i,p}) * Chip_{i,t,p} * I_{Close_{i,t} \geq Price_{i,p}}

CPGR_{i,t} = \frac{已实现盈利_{i,t}}{已实现盈利_{i,t} + 账面盈利_{i,t}}

